      "observations": [
        "The historical headless fallback uses elementFromPoint and row.click when it finds no target, while the ordinary path synthesizes the mouse action with modifiers. The retained accepted test instead targets the real row with synthesizeMouseAtCenter and keeps selection checks. A matching selected value alone does not prove the historical fallback exercised the same modifier path.",
